  "generator": "aero-engine sample content (authored here) -- task 3.5.2: the phase-3-skinning tube and chain (an 8-segment x 11-ring tube of radius 0.25 running 2 units along +Y, deformed by five joints J0..J4 at y = 0, 0.4, 0.8, 1.2 and 1.6, J0 a scene root, inverse bind matrices translation(0, -jointY, 0), weights a linear blend between the two nearest joints) carrying one 2-second animation that drives all three glTF paths through all three interpolation modes: J1, J2 and J3 rotate LINEARly 0.6 radians of phase apart for the wave, J4 pops between scale 1 and 1.75 on a STEP channel, and J0 bobs +/-0.35 on a CUBICSPLINE translation with zero tangents, so the loop is seamless and the ease-in and ease-out are visible. Every node is TRS-form and the buffer is embedded, so this file is self-contained and its cook is deterministic."
